    "Motif shapes come from a small catalogue plus random tight 3x3 masks. There are no shapes larger than 5x5 and none with even dimensions.",
    "Copies of the same colour may overlap each other, as in test 1. Copies of different colours may partly hide each other, but each stamped colour stays visible.",
    "Validate reproduces the canonical fixtures, which match the teaching fixtures. No corrections were applied."
  ],
